{"product_id":"forget-me-not-5","title":"Forget Me Not 5","description":"\u003cp\u003eCOMING OF AGEStill not fully healed from the wound of breaking up with Tsukushi and the shock of seeing Nobuta again, Serizawa starts an internship at a law firm. Through a mix-up over the phone, he becomes acquainted with a certain someone—a woman who otherwise wouldn't be in his reach! Will this chance encounter start Serizawa on the path to his first truly adult relationship?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Xu Yuting\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632363152\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45841446240409,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632363152","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69024cf17d1e0_images__2.jpg?v=1761759437","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/forget-me-not-5","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}